=2 Walkthrough
!King Ranperre's Tomb-map1.jpg|right|King Ranperre's Tomb Map 1
Trade enough {p:Crystals} to the {p:Conquest NPC} to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission, then accept it from the {n:Gate Guard}.
* You'll be instructed to go see {p:Prince Trion}. Visit him in his room at (H-7) in {z:Chateau d'Oraguille}
* If you're low level, gather a party or use {p:Trusts|Trust}.
* Head for (H-8) in {z:King Ranperre's Tomb} on Map 1.
** The Proto-Waypoint warp to {z:Jugner Forest} is the fastest way to get to the location in {z:King Ranperre's Tomb}.
* When ready, check the **Heavy Stone Door** to spawn three (3) {m:Skeleton} NMs: {m:Corrupted Soffeil} (BLM), {m:Corrupted Yorgos} (WAR) and {m:Corrupted Ulbrig} (BLM).
** They can be pulled one by one using {s:Sneak}.
** All 3 must be slain.
** The NMs are immune to {s:Sleep} and {s:Lullaby|Foe Lullaby}.
** They will use {s:Blood Saber}, so keep damage negating buffs up to reduce the HP regained.
** {m:Corrupted Yorgos} has approximately 7250 HP.
* When defeated, check the **Heavy Stone Door** again, and enter. Check the **Tombstone** inside for a cutscene, at the end of which, you'll receive the {@k} {k:Ancient San d'Orian book}.
** **(Optional)**: Return to {p:Prince Trion}, and you will be instructed to go see the {n:Gate Guard}.
* Talk to any {n:Gate Guard}. A cutscene will play out saying they sent the book to scholars to decipher.
* You must talk to the {n:Gate Guard} once more to have them tell you that the deciphering will take some time.
* **Zone** and talk to the {n:Guard|Gate Guard} again who will tell you to see {p:Prince Trion}.
* Return to {p:Prince Trion} and speak with him for a cutscene. You may need to talk to him twice.
* Return to the **Heavy Stone Door** in King Ranperre's Tomb again for another cutscene. You'll be instructed to defeat enemies, but you only need to activate the door again.
* Return to a {n:Gate Guard} to complete the Mission.

